# Canonical module-qualified public API, trait-derive, and impl-member surface for `crates/quota-core`
# Checked mechanically by `cargo xtask check-api-surface [--base <ref>]`.
# Exhaustive enum variant additions, required trait items, associated type changes, and signature/derive mutations are treated as SemVer-breaking.
